### 商家在线点单配置 API 测试

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002/api/order/v1
@merchantId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### 1. 创建商家配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subdomain": "sweet7",
  "enabled": true,
  "allowPickup": true,
  "allowDineIn": true,
  "allowDelivery": true,
  "minOrderAmount": 1000,
  "deliveryFee": 500,
  "deliveryRadius": 5.0,
  "businessHours": {
    "monday": { "open": "09:00", "close": "22:00", "closed": false },
    "tuesday": { "open": "09:00", "close": "22:00", "closed": false },
    "wednesday": { "open": "09:00", "close": "22:00", "closed": false },
    "thursday": { "open": "09:00", "close": "22:00", "closed": false },
    "friday": { "open": "09:00", "close": "22:00", "closed": false },
    "saturday": { "open": "10:00", "close": "23:00", "closed": false },
    "sunday": { "open": "10:00", "close": "23:00", "closed": false }
  },
  "themeSettings": {
    "primaryColor": "#f97316",
    "logoUrl": "https://example.com/logo.png",
    "bannerUrl": "https://example.com/banner.jpg"
  }
}

### 2. 根据子域名获取配置 (在线点单前端调用)
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant-config/by-subdomain/sweet7

### 3. 根据商家 ID 获取配置 (Portal 调用)
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config

### 4. 检查子域名可用性
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant-config/check-subdomain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subdomain": "sweet7"
}

### 5. 检查子域名可用性 (排除当前商家)
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant-config/check-subdomain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subdomain": "sweet7",
  "excludeMerchantId": "{{merchantId}}"
}

### 6. 更新商家配置
PUT {{baseUrl}}/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minOrderAmount": 1500,
  "deliveryFee": 600,
  "enabled": true
}

### 7. 更新子域名
PUT {{baseUrl}}/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subdomain": "sweet7-new"
}

### 8. 禁用在线点单
PUT {{baseUrl}}/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}

### 9. 启用在线点单
PUT {{baseUrl}}/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true
}

### 10. 获取所有配置 (管理员)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/merchant-configs?page=1&limit=20

### 11. 删除商家配置
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config

### 测试错误场景

### 12. 创建重复的子域名 (应该失败)
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchants/456e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subdomain": "sweet7",
  "enabled": true
}

### 13. 无效的子域名格式 (应该失败)
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subdomain": "-invalid",
  "enabled": true
}

### 14. 子域名太短 (应该失败)
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subdomain": "a",
  "enabled": true
}

### 15. 获取不存在的配置 (应该返回 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant-config/by-subdomain/nonexistent

### 16. 获取已禁用的配置 (应该返回 403)
# 先禁用,再尝试获取
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant-config/by-subdomain/sweet7
